type post
version 1
---
# A CRT monitor over the finished lit image (PostEffects.custom1): the
# screen bulges, scanlines and an RGB shadow mask cross it, and its rounded
# corners darken. crt.wgsl reads the pass before it with previous(uv).
source "post/crt.wgsl"
param curve float 0.1
param scanlines float 0.3
param lines float 240
param vignette float 0.6
